  "description": "Installation of an internally illuminated advert within a digital communications unit.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed advertisement, by reason of its scale, siting and appearance would result in an obtrusive and visually incongruous feature that contributes to an unsightly proliferation and clutter of signage and street furniture in the local area that would detract from the visual amenity of the street scene. As such, the proposal would be contrary to policies D4 (Delivering Good Design),&amp;nbsp; D8 (Public Realm) of the London Plan (2021) and policies PP1 (Public Realm), LP1 (High Quality Design) and LP7 (Advertisements) of Hackney&#x27;s Local Development Plan (2020).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
